Aim
To create an ATS-friendly resume webpage using basic HTML elements.

Description:
This experiment demonstrates the creation of a structured resume using basic
HTML. The webpage includes personal details, contact information, career
objective, educational qualifications, technical skills, work experience, projects,
certifications, strengths, languages known, and declaration. HTML elements
such as headings, paragraphs, lists, tables, images, and horizontal lines are used
to organize the resume.

Program:
